error BYN3102: `style.indent` must be a positive integer, e.g. `4`

  5 │         indent: "4",
    │                 ^^^

error BYN3102: `style.braces` must be removed: there is no brace knob, `{` always ends the line

  6 │         braces: .nextLine,
    │                 ^^^^^^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.maxLine` must be removed: use `style.width`

  7 │         maxLine: 100,
    │                  ^^^

error BYN3102: `style.width` must be a positive integer, e.g. `120`

  8 │         width: 0,
    │                ^

error BYN3102: `style.align` must be `.runs` or `.none`

  9 │         align: .left,
    │                ^^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.trailingCommas` must be `.multiline` or `.never`, not `true` or `false`

  10 │         trailingCommas: true,
     │                         ^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.lints` must be a known lint name: `guards.postfix`, `lambdas.it`,
`nesting.depth`, `functions.length`, `conditions.named`

  11 │         lints: ["guards.prefix": .warning, "lambdas.it": .loud],
     │                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.lints` must be `.none`, `.suggestion`, `.warning` or `.error` for `lambdas.it`

  11 │         lints: ["guards.prefix": .warning, "lambdas.it": .loud],
     │                                                          ^^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.booleans` must be `.symbols` or `.words`

  12 │         booleans: .both,
     │                   ^^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.primitives` must be `.sized` or `.csharp`

  13 │         primitives: .int,
     │                     ^^^^

error BYN3101: `tabs` is not a field of `Style`

  14 │         tabs: true,
     │         ^^^^
     │
  help: use one of the fields `indent`, `width`, `align`, `trailingCommas`, `booleans`,
        `primitives`, `lints`, `braces`, `maxLine`
